  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "商量撤掉视频  (Asking to Pull the Fan Video)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu meets Xin Huimei's fan-club president at a private clubhouse to ask whether his group can take down the backstage video showing the wrong sponsor water. Listen to Xiaogu make her case in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，谢谢你答应跟我见面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还不算是正式的制片人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那天在红毯上，你注意到我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你不也注意到我了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，我今天邀您见面，有一件事情想要拜托您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "爱美会拍摄的这条视频，您看方不方便把它撤掉？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们电视播出的画面没有错误。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "唯独你们拍摄的这条视频，是我们的唯一漏洞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "严格来说，未经过允许的拍摄是属于侵犯版权的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们爱美会拍摄视频，无非是为了回馈粉丝，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果你愿意撤掉视频，我们愿意出一些电视制作资源作为交换。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，谢谢你答应跟我见面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Xu, thank you for agreeing to meet with me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还不算是正式的制片人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not really count as a full producer yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那天在红毯上，你注意到我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That day on the red carpet, you noticed me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你不也注意到我了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not notice me as well?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，我今天邀您见面，有一件事情想要拜托您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Xu, I invited you to meet today because I have a favour to ask of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "爱美会拍摄的这条视频，您看方不方便把它撤掉？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would it be convenient for you to take down this video filmed by the fan club?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们电视播出的画面没有错误。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There was no mistake in the footage we broadcast on television.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "唯独你们拍摄的这条视频，是我们的唯一漏洞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only this video you filmed is our single loophole.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "严格来说，未经过允许的拍摄是属于侵犯版权的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Strictly speaking, filming without permission counts as copyright infringement.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们爱美会拍摄视频，无非是为了回馈粉丝，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your fan club filmed the video simply to give back to the fans, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果你愿意撤掉视频，我们愿意出一些电视制作资源作为交换。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are willing to take down the video, we will offer television production resources in exchange.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生，谢谢你答应跟我见面。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还不算是正式的制片人。",
      "gap": 0.5
